== Part 1: the 64 labelled 4-tournaments ==
  TT4                        c3=0  Pf distribution {-1: 12, 1: 12}
  3-cycle+source             c3=1  Pf distribution {-3: 4, 3: 4}
  strong (2 three-cycles)    c3=2  Pf distribution {-1: 12, 1: 12}
  3-cycle+sink               c3=1  Pf distribution {-3: 4, 3: 4}
  CONFIRMED: Pf in {+-1,+-3}; |Pf|=3 iff exactly one 3-cycle (3-cycle+source or 3-cycle+sink); Pf(B^sigma)=sgn(sigma)Pf(B); switching a vertex negates Pf
